{"ref":"BDB, חֲנוֹךְ","hw":"חֲנוֹךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנוֹךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Cain <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:17\" href=\"/Genesis.4.17\">Gn 4:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:18\" href=\"/Genesis.4.18\">18</a> 𝔊 Ενωχ, 𝔊L Ενως.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Jered (line of Seth), the pious Enoch, who walked with God and was taken by him <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:18\" href=\"/Genesis.5.18\">Gn 5:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:19\" href=\"/Genesis.5.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:21\" href=\"/Genesis.5.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:22\" href=\"/Genesis.5.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:23\" href=\"/Genesis.5.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:24\" href=\"/Genesis.5.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.3\">1 Ch 1:3</a> 𝔊 Ενωχ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנֹךְ</span> a son of Midian <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">Gn 25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">1 Ch 1:33</a>, 𝔊 Ενωχ.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנוֹךְ</span> a son of Reuben <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:9\" href=\"/Genesis.46.9\">Gn 46:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:14\" href=\"/Exodus.6.14\">Ex 6:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:5\" href=\"/Numbers.26.5\">Nu 26:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.3\">1 Ch 5:3</a>, 𝔊 Ενωχ.","next":"BDB, חֲנֹכִי","prev":"BDB, חָנַךְ"}